{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S03、S10 有短暂把重心放在享受当下、停止预想未来上，幸福与留不住它的痛楚暂时没有充分交织。\",\n    \"S05-S06 较多落在暴露心意后怕被嫌黏、担心对方如何看待自己的自我意识上，稍微偏向表达亲密时的心理负担。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07-S12 反复把亲密具体化为陪伴、被需要、成为对方需要时会想到的人，使主线逐渐偏向自己是否还有陪伴价值，而不再完全是亲密本身的幸福与不可留住。\",\n    \"S11 尤其把重点转成即使对方以后不需要陪伴，自己仍愿意陪在身边，偏向单方面持续付出的承诺，削弱了双方共同享有亲密又共同面临它可能消失的核心。\",\n    \"S03 中想表达喜欢的念头很快淡去，使这一段较少呈现亲密的渴望与失去可能性之间的牵连。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 更完整地保留了亲密本身的甜蜜、双方逐渐靠近的幸福，以及明明正在拥有却无法保证能够留住的痛楚，而且多次让两者同时发生。Y 虽然也具备这两面，但反复将它们收束到对方是否还需要自己的陪伴这一具体顾虑，因而缩窄了 Center 的范围。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99525c75-5835-433f-bde2-a3edf6a7071e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T100935872904Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:10:09.771127+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "57a32043e09a7ce8362bfbb036540768e40e19bfd92908e39e741fc7de149033", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\cha